<view class="container nav-safe home-page">
  <view class="topbar row"><view><view class="eyebrow">CLOUDTRACE · 云迹先知</view><view class="title">未来一小时<br/><text class="blue">哪里会受影响？</text></view></view><view class="live-pill"><view class="live-dot"></view><text>实时研判</text></view></view>
  <view class="subtitle intro">融合雷达回波、卫星云图与对象移动趋势，给出区域级强回波影响判断。</view>
  <view class="scenario-switch card row" bindtap="openScenario"><view><view class="caption">当前工作场景</view><view class="scenario-name">{{selectedScenarioData.label}}</view><view class="scenario-desc">{{selectedScenarioData.desc}}</view></view><text class="switch-arrow">⌄</text></view>
  <view class="map-card card-dark"><view class="map-head row"><view><text class="map-title">武汉及周边</text><text class="map-meta">雷达 + 卫星 · {{now}} 更新</text></view><text class="tag tag-live">VIL ≥ 32</text></view><view class="weather-map"><view class="map-grid"></view><view class="map-radar radar-a"></view><view class="map-radar radar-b"></view><view class="map-zone zone-red"></view><view class="map-zone zone-orange"></view><view class="map-zone zone-blue"></view><view class="map-label label-red">东湖高新区<br/><text>83%</text></view><view class="map-label label-orange">天河机场<br/><text>68%</text></view><view class="map-label label-blue">汉口核心区<br/><text>42%</text></view><view class="map-compass">N</view></view><view class="map-legend"><view><view class="legend-dot red"></view>重点关注</view><view><view class="legend-dot orange"></view>需关注</view><view><view class="legend-dot blue"></view>观察</view><text>+60 min</text></view></view>
  <view class="section-title section-gap row"><text>影响区域</text><text class="link" data-url="/pages/objects/index" bindtap="goPage">查看全部 ›</text></view>
  <view class="region-list"><block wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="id"><view class="region-card card"><view class="region-bar {{item.color}}"></view><view class="region-main"><view class="row"><text class="region-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="region-prob {{item.color}}">{{item.probability}}%</text></view><view class="row region-sub"><text class="tag {{item.color === 'red' ? 'tag-red' : item.color === 'orange' ? 'tag-orange' : 'tag-blue'}}">{{item.level}}</text><text>{{item.time}}</text></view><text class="region-reason">{{item.reason}}</text></view></view></block></view>
  <view class="section-title section-gap row"><text>判断依据</text><text class="link" data-url="/pages/evidence/index" bindtap="goPage">展开依据 ›</text></view>
  <view class="basis-preview card"><view class="basis-check">✓</view><view><text class="basis-title">主回波正在增强并向东南移动</text><text class="basis-copy">雷达 + 卫星 + 轨迹三类证据一致，影响区域判断可信度较高。</text></view></view>
  <view class="time-row"><text>起报 12:10</text><text class="time-line"></text><text>未来 +60 分钟</text></view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{showScenario}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeScenario"><view class="scenario-sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="sheet-handle"></view><view class="section-title">选择工作场景</view><block wx:for="{{scenarios}}" wx:key="id"><view class="scenario-option {{selectedScenario === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseScenario"><view class="scenario-icon">{{item.icon}}</view><view><text class="scenario-option-title">{{item.label}}</text><text class="caption">{{item.desc}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{selectedScenario === item.id}}" class="check">✓</text></view></block></view></view>


